  "body": "School zones, space and the beach: 274 Beach Road brings together three things families look for in Campbells Bay.\r\n\r\nSet on a 902m² freehold section, this five-bedroom, three-bathroom home is zoned for Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School, as well as Campbells Bay School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nThe downstairs bedroom with its own ensuite gives visiting parents, older children or guests a little more privacy. Polished timber floors, an open-plan kitchen and dining area, and underfloor heating in tiled areas make everyday living comfortable.\r\n\r\nThere’s space outside too, with front and rear gardens for children, pets and entertaining, plus generous parking.\r\n\r\nCampbells Bay Beach is a short stroll away, while Milford’s shops, cafés and supermarket are a short drive from home.\r\n\r\nFor families looking for a full section, flexible accommodation and these school zones, this is a home worth seeing.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nSchool zones are subject to change. Buyers should confirm current enrolment requirements directly with the schools.",
